# The wait is in the file, but not in the procedure

Round 2 of #1905 (B2). The check there asked whether the string `30초` appeared
anywhere in the file. So this edit passed it:

> **명령 2개로 나눠 치고 곧바로 이어 친다** (예전에는 30초를 기다렸다)

with the wait deleted from the commands. The procedure said, in so many words,
run them back to back — and the guard was green, because the number was still
somewhere on the page. That is the #1879 mechanism itself.

The wait has to be required between the two commands, not present in the file.
